OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigating deaths of two
OL,4,Amen found injured in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives in Glasgow are investigating
OL,7,Fthe deaths of two men who were found
OL,8,Fseriously injured in Partick.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to an address in
OL,11,FChancellor Street at about 16:40 on
OL,12,FSunday.
OL,14,FThe men - aged 50 and 54 - were
OL,15,Fpronounced dead at the scene and their
OL,16,Fdeaths are being treated as
OL,17,Funexplained.
OL,19,FPost-mortem examinations are due to be
OL,20,Fcarried out and police are calling for
OL,21,Fanyone with any information to come
OL,22,Fforward, external.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
